@startuml
skinparam backgroundColor white
skinparam shadowing false
skinparam defaultFontName SimSun
skinparam defaultFontSize 17
skinparam dpi 200
skinparam ArrowColor black
skinparam NoteBackgroundColor white
skinparam NoteBorderColor black
skinparam ActorBackgroundColor white
skinparam BoundaryBackgroundColor white
skinparam ControlBackgroundColor white
hide footbox
skinparam maxMessageSize 150
skinparam sequenceMessageAlign center
skinparam sequence {
 ParticipantBackgroundColor white
 ParticipantBorderColor black
 LifeLineBorderColor black
 LifeLineBackgroundColor white
 ArrowColor black
 GroupBackgroundColor white
 GroupBorderColor black
}
actor "前台" as A0
boundary "<u>:前台接口</u>" as B0
control "<u>:查询可用接诊安</u>\n<u>排控制</u>" as K
participant "<u>:日期安排</u>" as Schedule
participant "<u>:诊椅</u>" as Chair
participant "<u>:接诊占用</u>" as Occupancy
participant "工作单元" as W
participant "数据映射器" as DM
participant "权限与会话服务" as AUTH
A0 -> B0 : 查询UC-16办理依据
activate B0
B0 -> B0 : 检查输入格式()
B0 -> K : 查询(ctx, UC16Query)
activate K
group 同一读取快照
K -> W : 开始读事务()
W --> K : 同一连接
K -> AUTH : 核对岗位及对象(ctx, 引用)
AUTH --> K : 有效授权依据或拒绝
K -> DM : 装载(对象引用、连接)
DM --> K : 实体与依据快照
K -> Schedule : 提供可用组合(指定日期与时长)
activate Schedule
Schedule -> Chair : 核对可用区间(日期时段)
activate Chair
Chair --> Schedule : 处理结果或拒绝原因
deactivate Chair
Schedule -> Occupancy : 排除已有占用(患者、人员及诊椅)
activate Occupancy
Occupancy --> Schedule : 处理结果或拒绝原因
deactivate Occupancy
Schedule -> Schedule : 形成可用区间(排班、停诊及占用依据)
Schedule --> K : 处理结果或拒绝原因
deactivate Schedule
alt 本阶段全部校验通过
K -> W : 结束读事务()
else 任一步骤拒绝或保存失败
K -> W : 回滚()
end
end
K --> B0 : 本阶段结果及下一步依据
deactivate K
B0 --> A0 : 展示结果、状态和原因
deactivate B0
note over K,Occupancy
校验不通过时返回规约中的原因；
本阶段不留下部分有效结果。
end note

@enduml
